
title: FemaleLead
---
<<declare $metFemaleLead = false>>
<<declare $flReassured = false>>
<<declare $flManaQuestStarted = false>>
<<declare $flManaQuestComplete = false>>
<<declare $flSurvivorsDiscussed = false>>
<<declare $flPositiveInteractionUnlocked = false>>
<<declare $flPositiveInteractionSeen = false>>
<<declare $flStayedWithHer = false>>
<<declare $flSharedInvestigationInfo = false>>
<<declare $spokeToFemaleLeadAboutTower = false>>

<<if $metFemaleLead == false>>
    {$characterFLName}: {$playerName}?!
    {$characterFLName}: Oh, thank goodness!
    {$characterFLName}: You're here!
    {$playerName}: There you are!
    {$playerName}: I've been looking for you.
    {$characterFLName}: I'm sorry!
    {$characterFLName}: I really didn't mean to disappear.
    {$characterFLName}: I thought that if I explored a little, I might find a way out of this place.
    {$characterFLName}: You know... something useful.
    {$playerName}: You went looking for an exit?
    {$characterFLName}: Mhm!
    {$characterFLName}: I thought maybe I could find something before you did.
    {$characterFLName}: Just once, I wanted to be the one helping you.
    {$characterFLName}: And then...
    {$playerName}: You got lost?
    {$characterFLName}: ...
    {$characterFLName}: Very lost.
    {$characterFLName}: I forgot how easily I lose my way.
    {$characterFLName}: Every path started looking the same.
    {$characterFLName}: I tried to come back, but I kept going in circles.
    {$characterFLName}: Eventually, I was too scared to wander any further.
    {$characterFLName}: I thought if I moved again, I might never find you.
    {$playerName}: ...
    {$characterFLName}: But then you appeared!
    {$characterFLName}: I can't tell you how happy I am to see you.
    -> I'm just glad you're safe
        {$playerName}: I'm just glad you're safe.
        {$playerName}: I was worried about you.
        {$characterFLName}: You were?
        {$playerName}: Of course I was.
        {$characterFLName}: ...
        {$characterFLName}: Thank you.
        {$characterFLName}: I was worried about you too.
        <<set $flReassured = true>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterfl" 10>>
    -> You really need to stop getting lost
        {$playerName}: You really need to stop wandering off on your own.
        {$characterFLName}: I know...
        {$characterFLName}: I'm sorry.
        {$characterFLName}: I just wanted to help.
    -> At least you found something interesting
        {$playerName}: Well, at least you found something interesting.
        {$characterFLName}: Oh! You mean the portal?
        {$characterFLName}: Yes!
        {$characterFLName}: That's actually what I wanted to tell you!
    {$characterFLName}: Look over there!
    {$characterFLName}: That strange portal...
    {$characterFLName}: I found it while wandering around.
    {$characterFLName}: I haven't touched it, though.
    {$playerName}: Why not?
    {$characterFLName}: Well...
    {$characterFLName}: After getting lost once, I didn't really want to risk being sent away again.
    {$characterFLName}: But maybe it could lead us somewhere!
    {$characterFLName}: Somewhere safer, hopefully.
    {$playerName}: It's worth investigating.
    {$characterFLName}: I think so too!
    {$characterFLName}: Although...
    {$playerName}: Something wrong?
    {$characterFLName}: I've been feeling a little strange since we arrived here.
    {$characterFLName}: My magic doesn't feel quite right.
    {$characterFLName}: Even simple spells seem harder than they should.
    {$playerName}: Is it because of what happened before we woke up here?
    {$characterFLName}: I don't know.
    {$characterFLName}: But it feels like something is holding me back.
    {$characterFLName}: I thought maybe if I could restore my mana, I could start raising my levels again.
    {$characterFLName}: Maybe then I'd be strong enough to help properly.
    {$playerName}: You need a Mana Potion?
    {$characterFLName}: That would be wonderful!
    {$characterFLName}: If you happen to find one, could you bring it to me?
    -> Of course. I'll get you one
        {$playerName}: Of course. I'll find you a Mana Potion.
        {$characterFLName}: Really?
        {$characterFLName}: Thank you!
        {$characterFLName}: I promise I'll make good use of it.
        <<set $flManaQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "fl_mana_potion">>
    -> I'll see what I can do
        {$playerName}: I'll keep an eye out for one.
        {$characterFLName}: That's more than enough.
        {$characterFLName}: Thank you for helping me.
        <<set $flManaQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "fl_mana_potion">>
    -> Maybe later
        {$playerName}: I've got a few other things to do first.
        {$characterFLName}: Oh, that's alright!
        {$characterFLName}: I don't want to be a burden.
        {$characterFLName}: Just... come back when you can, okay?
    <<set $metFemaleLead = true>>
<<else>>
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
<<endif>>
===
title: FemaleLeadReturn
---
{$characterFLName}: {$playerName}!
{$characterFLName}: You're back!
-> Offer to find a Mana Potion <<if $flManaQuestStarted == false && $flManaQuestComplete == false>>
    {$playerName}: I'll find you that Mana Potion.
    {$characterFLName}: Really?
    {$characterFLName}: Thank you so much!
    <<set $flManaQuestStarted = true>>
    <<start_quest QuestManager "fl_mana_potion">>
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
-> Give her the Mana Potion <<if $flManaQuestStarted == true && $flManaQuestComplete == false && has_item("mana_potion")>>
    {$playerName}: Here. I found this for you.
    {$characterFLName}: Really?
    {$characterFLName}: For me?
    {$playerName}: Of course.
    <<remove_item GameManager "mana_potion">>
    <<set $flManaQuestComplete = true>>
    <<complete_quest QuestManager "fl_mana_potion">>
    <<change_affection GameManager "characterfl" 15>>
    {$characterFLName}: Thank you so much!
    {$characterFLName}: I can already feel my mana returning.
    {$playerName}: Feeling better?
    {$characterFLName}: Much better!
    {$characterFLName}: Although...
    {$characterFLName}: There's still something strange about my magic.
    {$playerName}: We'll figure it out.
    {$characterFLName}: Together?
    {$playerName}: Together.
    {$characterFLName}: Hehe...
    {$characterFLName}: I'd like that.
    <<if $flSurvivorsDiscussed == true>>
        <<set $flPositiveInteractionUnlocked = true>>
    <<endif>>
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
-> Ask about the Mana Potion <<if $flManaQuestStarted == true && $flManaQuestComplete == false>>
    {$playerName}: I haven't forgotten about your Mana Potion.
    {$characterFLName}: Thank you!
    {$characterFLName}: I'm sure we'll find one somewhere.
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
-> Talk about the other survivors
    <<jump FemaleLeadSurvivors>>
-> Ask about the portal
    {$playerName}: Have you discovered anything else about the portal?
    {$characterFLName}: Not much, unfortunately.
    {$characterFLName}: It seems stable, but I can't tell where it leads.
    {$characterFLName}: I'd rather not test it alone.
    {$playerName}: Probably a good idea.
    {$characterFLName}: See? I'm learning!
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
-> Stay with her for a while
    <<jump FemaleLeadStay>>
-> Ask about the tower incident <<if $towerInvestigationStarted == true && $spokeToFemaleLeadAboutTower == false>>
    {$playerName}: Do you remember anything about what happened before we arrived here?
    {$characterFLName}: A little...
    {$characterFLName}: I remember a strange light.
    {$characterFLName}: Everything started shaking, and I could barely stand.
    {$characterFLName}: I tried to reach you, but...
    {$characterFLName}: Then everything went dark.
    {$playerName}: And you woke up here?
    {$characterFLName}: Yes.
    {$characterFLName}: I don't remember anything between those moments.
    {$characterFLName}: I'm sorry I can't tell you more.
    {$playerName}: It's alright. That still helps.
    <<set $spokeToFemaleLeadAboutTower = true>>
    <<set $towerPeopleSpokenTo += 1>>
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
-> Spend some time together <<if $flPositiveInteractionUnlocked == true>>
    <<jump FemaleLeadPositiveInteraction>>
-> Leave
    {$playerName}: I'll be back soon.
    {$characterFLName}: Okay!
    {$characterFLName}: Just be careful out there.
===
 
title: FemaleLeadSurvivors
---
<<if $flSurvivorsDiscussed == true>>
    {$characterFLName}: It's nice knowing we're not the only ones here.
    {$characterFLName}: Everyone seems so different!
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
<<else>>
    {$characterFLName}: Have you met anyone else around here?
    {$playerName}: A few people, actually.
    {$characterFLName}: Really?
    {$characterFLName}: What are they like?
    <<if $metLiliana == true>>
        {$playerName}: I met Liliana.
        {$playerName}: She's been trying to understand what happened.
        {$characterFLName}: She sounds lovely!
        {$characterFLName}: I hope she's doing alright.
    <<endif>>
    <<if $metThalia == true>>
        {$playerName}: There's also Thalia.
        {$playerName}: She's a thief, and she's quite confident.
        {$characterFLName}: A thief?
        {$characterFLName}: Oh my!
        {$characterFLName}: Well, I suppose that doesn't mean she's a bad person.
        {$characterFLName}: Maybe we could become friends!
    <<endif>>
    <<if $metTeysa == true>>
        {$playerName}: I met Teysa, an alchemist.
        {$playerName}: She was admiring the floating islands.
        {$characterFLName}: An alchemist!
        {$characterFLName}: That sounds exciting!
        {$characterFLName}: I'd love to hear about her experiments.
    <<endif>>
    <<if $metElenda == true>>
        {$playerName}: There's also Elenda, the Ashen Witch.
        {$playerName}: She's researching the magic around here.
        {$characterFLName}: The Ashen Witch?
        {$characterFLName}: That sounds a little intimidating...
        {$characterFLName}: But maybe she knows something that could help us.
    <<endif>>
    <<if $metVillager == true>>
        {$playerName}: I also met a villager who seems to be lost.
        {$characterFLName}: Oh no!
        {$characterFLName}: I know exactly how that feels.
        {$characterFLName}: I hope they're okay.
    <<endif>>
    <<if $metMerchant == true>>
        {$playerName}: And there's a merchant selling supplies.
        {$characterFLName}: Really?
        {$characterFLName}: That's good news!
        {$characterFLName}: At least we'll have somewhere to get what we need.
    <<endif>>
    {$characterFLName}: Wow...
    {$characterFLName}: Everyone sounds so different.
    {$characterFLName}: It's strange, isn't it?
    {$characterFLName}: All these people, with completely different lives...
    {$characterFLName}: Yet somehow we've all ended up in the same place.
    {$playerName}: Yeah. It's a strange group.
    {$characterFLName}: But maybe that's a good thing.
    {$characterFLName}: Everyone has something unique about them.
    {$characterFLName}: Maybe if we work together, we'll find a way home.
    {$characterFLName}: And maybe...
    {$characterFLName}: We won't have to face whatever is happening here alone.
    {$playerName}: I think you're right.
    {$characterFLName}: Hehe!
    {$characterFLName}: I feel a little better already.
    <<set $flSurvivorsDiscussed = true>>
    <<change_affection GameManager "characterfl" 15>>
    <<if $flManaQuestComplete == true>>
        <<set $flPositiveInteractionUnlocked = true>>
    <<endif>>
    <<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
<<endif>>
===
title: FemaleLeadStay
---
{$characterFLName}: You want to stay here for a little while?
{$playerName}: Yeah. I thought you might like some company.
{$characterFLName}: ...
{$characterFLName}: I'd really like that.
{$characterFLName}: You know...
{$characterFLName}: When I was waiting here, I kept telling myself not to be afraid.
{$characterFLName}: But every time I looked at the portal...
{$characterFLName}: I wondered what would happen if you never found me.
{$playerName}: You don't have to worry about that now.
{$characterFLName}: I know.
{$characterFLName}: It's just...
{$characterFLName}: Everything feels a little uncertain.
{$characterFLName}: But when you're here, it doesn't seem quite so frightening.
<<if $flStayedWithHer == false>>
    <<change_affection GameManager "characterfl" 5>>
    <<set $flStayedWithHer = true>>
<<endif>>
{$characterFLName}: Thank you for staying with me.
<<jump FemaleLeadReturn>>
===
title: FemaleLeadRelationship
---
{$characterFLName}: {$playerName}!
{$characterFLName}: I'm so happy to see you!
<<if $flPositiveInteractionSeen == true>>
    {$characterFLName}: I've been thinking about our conversation.
    {$characterFLName}: It makes me feel better knowing we're facing this together.
<<else>>
    {$characterFLName}: I've been feeling much better lately.
    {$characterFLName}: I think talking about everyone helped more than I expected.
<<endif>>
-> Ask how she's feeling
    {$playerName}: How are you feeling now?
    {$characterFLName}: Better!
    {$characterFLName}: My mana is recovering, and I think I'm getting used to this place.
    {$characterFLName}: Although I still feel a little strange sometimes.
    {$playerName}: Strange how?
    {$characterFLName}: It's hard to explain.
    {$characterFLName}: Like something inside me is changing.
    {$characterFLName}: But I'm trying not to worry about it too much.
    <<jump FemaleLeadRelationship>>
-> Talk about the other survivors
    <<jump FemaleLeadSurvivors>>
-> Spend some time together
    <<jump FemaleLeadPositiveInteraction>>
-> Ask about the portal
    {$playerName}: Do you think the portal is safe?
    {$characterFLName}: I don't know for sure.
    {$characterFLName}: But I think it might be our best chance to leave.
    {$characterFLName}: Whatever happens, I hope we can face it together.
    <<jump FemaleLeadRelationship>>
<<if $towerInvestigationStarted == true && $spokeToFemaleLeadAboutTower == false>>
-> Ask about the tower incident
    {$playerName}: Do you remember anything about what happened before we arrived here?
    {$characterFLName}: A little...
    {$characterFLName}: I remember a strange light.
    {$characterFLName}: Everything started shaking, and I could barely stand.
    {$characterFLName}: I tried to reach you, but...
    {$characterFLName}: Then everything went dark.
    {$playerName}: And you woke up here?
    {$characterFLName}: Yes.
    {$characterFLName}: I don't remember anything between those moments.
    {$characterFLName}: I'm sorry I can't tell you more.
    {$playerName}: It's alright. That still helps.
    <<set $spokeToFemaleLeadAboutTower = true>>
    <<set $towerPeopleSpokenTo += 1>>
<<endif>>
-> Leave
    {$playerName}: I'll see you soon.
    {$characterFLName}: I'll be waiting!
===
title: FemaleLeadPositiveInteraction
---
{$characterFLName}: I'm glad you came back.
{$characterFLName}: There's something I've been wanting to tell you.
{$playerName}: What is it?
{$characterFLName}: When I first woke up here, I was terrified.
{$characterFLName}: I tried to act brave.
{$characterFLName}: I thought that if I found a way out, I could make everything better.
{$characterFLName}: But I got lost.
{$characterFLName}: And when I couldn't find you, I started thinking...
{$characterFLName}: What if I'm not strong enough to help anyone?
{$playerName}: ...
{$characterFLName}: I know I always try to be positive.
{$characterFLName}: But sometimes it's difficult.
{$characterFLName}: Especially when my magic isn't working properly.
{$characterFLName}: And lately...
{$characterFLName}: I keep feeling like something is wrong with me.
{$playerName}: What do you mean?
{$characterFLName}: I don't know.
{$characterFLName}: It's almost like something is slowly changing.
{$characterFLName}: I don't want to become someone you don't recognise.
{$playerName}: ...
{$characterFLName}: Do you think I'll still be able to help everyone?
-> You don't have to face this alone
    {$playerName}: You don't have to do everything by yourself.
    {$playerName}: Whatever happens, we'll face it together.
    {$characterFLName}: ...
    {$characterFLName}: You really mean that?
    {$playerName}: Of course.
    {$characterFLName}: Thank you.
    {$characterFLName}: That means everything to me.
    <<if $flPositiveInteractionSeen == false>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterfl" 5>>
    <<endif>>
-> You're already helping more than you know
    {$playerName}: You don't realise how much you already help people.
    {$playerName}: Just being here makes things a little easier.
    {$characterFLName}: Really?
    {$playerName}: Really.
    {$characterFLName}: ...
    {$characterFLName}: You're going to make me cry.
    <<if $flPositiveInteractionSeen == false>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterfl" 5>>
    <<endif>>
-> We need you to become stronger
    {$playerName}: We'll need everyone to become stronger if we're going to survive.
    {$characterFLName}: You're right.
    {$characterFLName}: I'll keep working hard.
    {$characterFLName}: I promise I won't give up.
<<set $flPositiveInteractionSeen = true>>
{$characterFLName}: You know...
{$characterFLName}: Even though this place is frightening, I'm glad we found each other again.
{$characterFLName}: And I'm glad we've met so many different people.
{$characterFLName}: Maybe this journey won't be so terrible after all.
{$playerName}: Maybe not.
{$characterFLName}: Hehe!
{$characterFLName}: Come on.
{$characterFLName}: Let's keep going, together.
===
